        <p><strong>ppmf_DataverseConnectionReference</strong> — used by flows that read and write <code>ppmf_errorevent</code> records in Dataverse. Requires a Dataverse connection authenticated to an account with access to this environment.</p>
        <p><strong>ppmf_TeamsConnectionReference</strong> — used by the error handler flows to post adaptive card alerts. Requires a Teams connection authenticated to an account that is a member of the target Teams team.</p>
